{"id":"9219de2ac0937f15","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-epsilon0.md","title":"ε₀ 的不动点与幂塔刻画","display":"thm-epsilon0 — ε₀ 的不动点与幂塔刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-epsilon0","aliases":["18-thm-epsilon0"],"display":"thm-epsilon0 — ε₀ 的不动点与幂塔刻画","depends_on":["[[18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal]]","[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","[[18-df-omega-tower]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"§3.3.1; Lemma 3.4.8(2)","source_pages":"33, 37","source_pdf_pages":"43, 47","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-with-local-proof"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-epsilon0"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-epsilon0</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-epsilon0 — ε₀ 的不动点与幂塔刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9fc246f88d0f85c8\" href=\"?note=9fc246f88d0f85c8\" title=\"18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal\">18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdee91a683a5c7c3\" href=\"?note=fdee91a683a5c7c3\" title=\"18-df-omega-tower\">18-df-omega-tower</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.3.1; Lemma 3.4.8(2)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"33, 37"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"43, 47"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-with-local-proof"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9fc246f88d0f85c8\" href=\"?note=9fc246f88d0f85c8\" title=\"18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal\">18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_1\">\\(\\varphi_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_n\">\\(\\omega_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdee91a683a5c7c3\" href=\"?note=fdee91a683a5c7c3\" title=\"18-df-omega-tower\">18-df-omega-tower</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0=\\varphi_1(0)=\\sup_{n&lt;\\omega}\\omega_n(1)=\\sup_{n&lt;\\omega}\\omega_n(\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varepsilon_0=\\varphi_1(0)=\\sup_{n&lt;\\omega}\\omega_n(1)=\\sup_{n&lt;\\omega}\\omega_n(\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{\\varepsilon_0}=\\varepsilon_0\\land\n\\forall\\xi&lt;\\varepsilon_0\\;(\\omega^\\xi&lt;\\varepsilon_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\omega^{\\varepsilon_0}=\\varepsilon_0\\land\n\\forall\\xi&lt;\\varepsilon_0\\;(\\omega^\\xi&lt;\\varepsilon_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>φ₁ 枚举 φ₀ 的不动点，故 φ₁(0) 是最小 ε 数（Lemma 3.4.8(2)）。ωₙ(ω)=ωₙ₊₁(1)，故两个塔只差首项；不动点及其下闭包由连续性、严格递增性与最小性导出。已核对应原书陈述；塔等式是本地完整推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-least-epsil